        "en": "Friendly and experienced independent staff"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Shoppers consistently praise the shop staff for their warm welcomes, knowledgeable advice, and attentive customer service. Multiple reviewers highlight expert guidance on caring for koi fish and choosing appropriate pet foods. One customer noted an issue regarding bird identification, but the overwhelming consensus highlights helpful service."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "place",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 10,
      "title": {
        "en": "Well stocked local pet store"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Visitors appreciate the extensive variety of pet supplies, bird feed, and natural treats available in this independent Kings Heath store. Customers describe the shop floor as clean, tidy, and much more personal than large corporate retailers. Regular shoppers also highlight the convenience of the store loyalty card for discounts."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 7,
      "title": {
        "en": "Well cared for resident pets"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Families and pet owners enjoy seeing the resident animals, including rabbits, guinea pigs, fish, and Max the parrot. Reviewers frequently remark that animals in the shop look healthy, clean, and treated with genuine care. Several clients mention purchasing small pets such as hamsters and bunnies with thorough guidance from staff."
      }
    }
  ],
